 body='<!-- SPDX-License-Identifier: CC-BY-4.0 -->\n# '+item['key']+'\n\nDecision: '+decision+' / SOURCE_REVIEW\n\n'+profile+'\n\n## Definition read\n'+ '\n'.join(sections)+'\n\n## Current owner and applicability\n\n'+ '; '.join(owners)+'\n\n'+gap+'\n\n## Baseline and contract\n\n'+d['baseline']['plan']+'\n\n'+d['requested_output_contract']+'\n\n## Primary outcome and falsifier\n\n'+item['primary_metric']+'\n\n'+falsifier+'\n\n## Bounded next test / reopening\n\n'+nxt+'\n\nNo new candidate or test executed. This is not negative experimental evidence or survivor qualification. Full cited source digests were checked.\n'
